{"unit_id":"KexinCC__dsh-kimi-assemble#card-zh","repo":"KexinCC/dsh-kimi-assemble","commit":"e5ffdd850ec502d152aab0a897eb87528c642d0f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-kimi-assemble**（DSH 插件，任意支持工具的客户端）：把 Kimi 浏览器扩展和 KimiCU 桌面代理接入 DSH，注册状态诊断、浏览器及桌面操作工具。用户可读取页面结构与差异、搜索或操作网页、查看截图，也可观察 Windows 窗口并执行鼠标键盘动作；浏览器和桌面流程都能批量运行。适合需要让 DSH 使用现有浏览器会话或操作 Windows 图形界面的场景。使用前需准备相应的本地桥接组件；桌面功能需要 Windows。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:44","lib/tools/index.mjs:19","lib/tools/browser.mjs:643","lib/tools/computer.mjs:190"]}
{"unit_id":"KexinCC__dsh-kimi-assemble#card-en","repo":"KexinCC/dsh-kimi-assemble","commit":"e5ffdd850ec502d152aab0a897eb87528c642d0f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-kimi-assemble** connects Kimi browser and desktop bridges to DSH. It reads pages, operates tabs and forms, captures screenshots, inspects Windows apps, and sends desktop input. It batches actions. Use it to automate browsers or Windows GUIs; desktop control needs Windows and local bridges.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:44","lib/tools/index.mjs:19","lib/tools/browser.mjs:643","lib/tools/computer.mjs:190"]}
