{"unit_id":"KexinCC__dsh-kimi-assemble#feature-1","repo":"KexinCC/dsh-kimi-assemble","commit":"e5ffdd850ec502d152aab0a897eb87528c642d0f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kimi-assemble 的功能「读取与检索网页」：读取当前页面的无障碍树、页面状态、指定子树或 iframe，也可按关键词查找并只返回上次读取后的差异。通过 kimi_browser_read 调用，可选附带截图。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools/browser.mjs:643"]}
{"unit_id":"KexinCC__dsh-kimi-assemble#feature-2","repo":"KexinCC/dsh-kimi-assemble","commit":"e5ffdd850ec502d152aab0a897eb87528c642d0f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kimi-assemble 的功能「网页交互」：打开页面、点击元素、填写输入框并执行键盘、滚动、拖拽或上传等动作；点击和多数交互会报告页面是否变化。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools/browser.mjs:565","lib/tools/browser.mjs:791","lib/tools/browser.mjs:1106"]}
{"unit_id":"KexinCC__dsh-kimi-assemble#feature-3","repo":"KexinCC/dsh-kimi-assemble","commit":"e5ffdd850ec502d152aab0a897eb87528c642d0f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kimi-assemble 的功能「Windows 桌面操作」：列出并观察窗口，返回无障碍树和可选截图，再按元素或坐标发送点击、输入、按键、滚动等动作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools/computer.mjs:154","lib/tools/computer.mjs:190","lib/tools/computer.mjs:305"]}
